    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the mental hygiene law, in relation to the implementation of the New York achieving a better life experience (NY ABLE) savings account act",
    "basePrintNo": "S7882",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S7882-2015",
    "coSponsors": {
